<in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock contextRef="OneD">1.The above unaudited consolidated financial results, have been reviewed by the Audit Committee and thereafter approved by the Board of Directors of the Holding Company at their respective meetings held on 5th August, 2024.      2. During the quarter, the Company has disposed of its entire investment in its foreign subsidiary Century Ply (Singapore) Pte. Ltd. along with its step down foreign subsidiaries namely- Century Ply Laos Co. Ltd. and Century Huesoulin Plywood Lao Co. Ltd.  This resulted in de-recognition of all assets &amp; liabilities and amount of non-controlling interests of aforesaid subsidiaries at the carrying amount as on date of disposal. In accordance with Ind AS 110, the resulting difference of Rs. 1333.45 Lacs, after adjusting the fair value of consideration received is recognized as loss attributable to the Company (Parent) and shown as Exceptional Item. However such loss did not involve any cash outflow of the Company.            3. The figures for the quarter ended 31st March, 2024 are the balancing figures between audited figures in respect of the full financial year ended 31st March, 2024 and unaudited published year to date figures for the nine months upto 31st December, 2023, which were subjected to limited review as required under the Listing Regulations.      4. Previous period figures have been re-arranged /re-grouped wherever necessary to make them comparable with current period figures.</in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock>
